    Up/Down Navigate   Enter Select   Esc Back    EXACT VERIFIED ACTION DETAILS
    OUTCOME  freight.dispatch
    WHEN     The shipment is ready and its dock slot is reserved under the same trusted carrier and customer account.
    THEN     Atomically dispatch the shipment and consume its dock slot, checking and incrementing both maintained counters.
    REFUSE   A cancelled or already dispatched shipment. A slot that is not reserved. Any request outside the trusted carrier and account.
    REVIEW   1 distinct dispatcher approval
    APPLY    Separately supervised; never model authority
    PRIVATE  shipment: account_id, carrier_id, id, rev_no, slot_id; slot: account_id, carrier_id, id, rev_no
    EXAMPLES
    +--------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------+
    | Case         | Scenario                                              | Result                                                      |
    +--------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------+
    | eligible     | Ready800kg shipment with reserved slot and available  | Automatic approval within10 per carrier per                 |
    |              | carrier allowance.                                    | rolling86400seconds.                                        |
    | human_review | Ready1500kg shipment with reserved slot.              | One dispatcher must approve.                                |
    | ineligible   | Ready shipment whose slot is consumed.                | Refuse; neither row changes.                                |
    +--------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------+
